
  <main id="main">

    <!-- ============ 1. HERO ============ -->
    <section class="hero ai-hero" aria-labelledby="heroTitle">
      <div class="container hero__inner ai-hero__grid">
        <div class="ai-hero__top">
          <span class="eyebrow">Websites · Automation · Dashboards · AI</span>
          <h1 id="heroTitle">Your business shouldn&rsquo;t have to <em>work this hard.</em></h1>
        </div>
        <div class="hero__copy">
          <p class="lead">We build websites, automations, dashboards and AI-powered tools that help businesses spend less time on repetitive work and more time getting things done.</p>
          <p class="hero__sub">You don&rsquo;t need to know which technology you need. Start with the problem.</p>
          <div class="btn-row hero__cta">
            <a href="#make-easier" class="btn btn--primary btn--large" data-track="cta-hero-find">Find a better way to work</a>
            <a href="ai-demos" class="btn btn--ghost btn--large" data-track="cta-hero-examples">See what&rsquo;s possible</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero__visual ai-hero__visual">
          <figure class="pv reveal" data-pv aria-label="An example of an AI system at work: an incoming enquiry is read, its requirements extracted, the knowledge base checked and a reply prepared for a person to approve. Preparation time drops from about 15 minutes to about 3.">
            <div class="pv__head">
              <span class="pv__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="pv__title" data-pv-title>Enquiry handling</span>
              <span class="pv__tag">Example</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pv__in" data-pv-in>
              <span class="pv__from" data-pv-from>New email · info@</span>
              <p data-pv-msg>Hi, we're buying a house in Edenvale for R2.4m and need transfer done before 30 November. What do you charge, and what do you need from us?</p>
            </div>
            <ol class="pv__steps">
              <li class="pv__step" data-pv-step="0"><span class="pv__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h10M4 18h7"/></svg></span><div><b data-pv-s0>Requirements extracted</b><span class="pv__chips" data-pv-c0></span></div></li>
              <li class="pv__step" data-pv-step="1"><span class="pv__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 4h10l4 4v12H5z"/><path d="M14 4v5h5"/></svg></span><div><b data-pv-s1>Knowledge base checked</b><span class="pv__src" data-pv-c1></span></div></li>
              <li class="pv__step" data-pv-step="2"><span class="pv__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 20l4-1 11-11-3-3L5 16z"/></svg></span><div><b data-pv-s2>Reply prepared for approval</b><span class="pv__draft" data-pv-c2></span></div></li>
            </ol>
            <div class="pv__result">
              <span class="pv__label" data-pv-metric>Preparation time per enquiry</span>
              <div class="pv__nums"><s data-pv-before>~15 min</s><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg><b data-pv-after>~3 min</b></div>
              <div class="pv__bar" aria-hidden="true"><i data-pv-bar></i></div>
            </div>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ 2. RECOGNISE THE PROBLEM ============ -->
    <section class="section" id="make-easier" aria-labelledby="easierTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Start with the problem</span>
          <h2 id="easierTitle">What would you like to make easier?</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="prob-grid">
          <a class="prob reveal" href="ai-for-business#library" data-track="problem-save-time"><span class="prob__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 7v5l3 2M12 3a9 9 0 1 0 0 18 9 9 0 0 0 0-18z"/></svg></span><b>Save time</b><span>Reduce repetitive admin and manual work.</span><i>See how &rarr;</i></a>
          <a class="prob reveal" href="services#websites" data-track="problem-customers"><span class="prob__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 19l5-6 4 3 7-9M15 7h5v5"/></svg></span><b>Get more customers</b><span>Improve your website, enquiries and follow-ups.</span><i>See how &rarr;</i></a>
          <a class="prob reveal" href="services#dashboards" data-track="problem-numbers"><span class="prob__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 20V10M10 20V4M16 20v-7M22 20H2"/></svg></span><b>Understand your numbers</b><span>Turn scattered business data into useful information.</span><i>See how &rarr;</i></a>
          <button type="button" class="prob reveal" data-review-open data-review-goal="Improve how my business works" data-track="problem-improve"><span class="prob__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 4v5h5M20 20v-5h-5M4.5 9A8 8 0 0 1 19 7M19.5 15A8 8 0 0 1 5 17"/></svg></span><b>Improve how your business works</b><span>Explore a better way to handle an existing process.</span><i>Tell us about it &rarr;</i></button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ 3. SHOW WHAT'S POSSIBLE ============ -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="examples" aria-labelledby="exTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Working examples</span>
          <h2 id="exTitle">See what a better process could look like.</h2>
          <p>Three examples, not a menu: most businesses need one of these, not all three. Each one runs, so you can try it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ex-grid">
          <article class="ex-card reveal">
            <span class="ex-card__k">Enquiries</span>
            <h3>Automated enquiry handling</h3>
            <dl><dt>The problem</dt><dd>Enquiries arrive by phone, email and WhatsApp, and details get lost or answered late.</dd><dt>What it does</dt><dd>Captures the enquiry, organises the details into a job card and triggers the right follow-up.</dd></dl>
            <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" href="ai-demos#calls" data-track="demo-open-enquiry">Try it &rarr;</a>
          </article>
          <article class="ex-card reveal">
            <span class="ex-card__k">Numbers</span>
            <h3>A business dashboard</h3>
            <dl><dt>The problem</dt><dd>Sales, stock and jobs sit in different spreadsheets, so nobody sees the whole picture.</dd><dt>What it does</dt><dd>Pulls the numbers into one view you can read in a minute, updated for you.</dd></dl>
            <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" href="demos#sales-dashboard" data-track="demo-open-dashboard">Try it &rarr;</a>
          </article>
          <article class="ex-card reveal">
            <span class="ex-card__k">Knowledge</span>
            <h3>An AI knowledge assistant</h3>
            <dl><dt>The problem</dt><dd>Staff search PDFs and shared drives, or interrupt the one person who knows.</dd><dt>What it does</dt><dd>Answers questions from your own documents, shows the source, and says when it doesn&rsquo;t know.</dd></dl>
            <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" href="ai-demos#rag" data-track="demo-open-knowledge">Try it &rarr;</a>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="section__foot btn-row reveal"><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="ai-demos" data-track="cta-all-examples">See all the examples</a></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ 4. PRICING & PROCESS ============ -->
    <section class="section" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="pricingTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Pricing &amp; process</span>
          <h2 id="pricingTitle">Clear pricing. Practical solutions. No guesswork.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="pp reveal">
          <div>
            <ul class="price-list">
              <li><span class="pl-name">Websites</span><span class="price"><small>from</small>R1,000</span></li>
              <li><span class="pl-name">Dashboards</span><span class="price"><small>from</small>R2,000</span></li>
              <li><span class="pl-name">Automations</span><span class="price"><small>from</small>R2,000</span></li>
              <li><span class="pl-name">AI solutions</span><span class="price"><small>from</small>R3,500</span></li>
              <li><span class="pl-name">Custom software</span><span class="price"><small>from</small>R4,500</span></li>
            </ul>
            <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.8rem">Starting prices, not fixed prices: the final cost depends on scope, integrations and complexity. Ongoing costs such as hosting, subscriptions, AI usage and support are shown separately before you agree to anything.</p>
          </div>
          <ol class="pp-steps">
            <li><span><b>Tell us what you want to improve</b></span></li>
            <li><span><b>We identify a practical solution</b></span></li>
            <li><span><b>You get a fixed proposal</b> before any development</span></li>
            <li><span><b>We build it</b> and you review it</span></li>
            <li><span><b>We launch</b> once the work is approved and payment terms are met</span></li>
          </ol>
        </div>
        <div class="section__foot btn-row reveal"><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="pricing" data-track="cta-pricing">Full pricing &amp; what affects cost</a></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ 5. FINAL CTA ============ -->
    <section class="cta" aria-labelledby="ctaTitle">
      <div class="container cta__inner reveal">
        <h2 id="ctaTitle">Not sure what you need? That&rsquo;s fine.</h2>
        <p>Tell us what&rsquo;s frustrating you, what takes too long, or what you wish your business could do better. We&rsquo;ll help you explore a practical solution.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--light btn--large" data-review-open data-track="cta-final-tell">Tell us what&rsquo;s slowing you down</button>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted cta__paths">Or <a class="inline-link" href="ai-demos" data-track="cta-final-examples">see what&rsquo;s possible</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="start" data-track="cta-final-estimate">get an estimate</a> if you already know what you want</p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

